[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800400_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800400_03_0010","text":"（啊，路加酱……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800400_03_0020","text":"（这个时间段，本来应该只有我一个人的——）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800400_03_0030","text":"（……哇！\n　刚才那下，好厉害……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800400_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800400_03_0040","text":"────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800400_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800400_03_0050","text":"──────啧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800400_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800400_03_0060","text":"啊？\n你在这啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800400_03_0070","text":"什么啊，那副架势……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800400_03_0080","text":"……对、对不起\n因为你太帅了，不自觉就……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800400_03_0090","text":"刚才根本完全没动起来吧——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800400_03_0100","text":"那个，不是那个意思……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800400_03_0110","text":"…………\n刚才的路加酱，也很帅啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800400_03_0111","text":"Motion"}]
